art of the gmina is 7,465).\"}, \"D1S4\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0065-009ad1444e70:d00\", \"start\": 469, \"end\": 675, \"text\": \"Apart from the town of Gniewkowo, Gmina Gniewkowo contains the villages and settlements of Bąbolin, Branno, Buczkowo, Chrząstowo, Dąblin, Gąski, Godzięba, Kaczkowo, Kawęczyn, Kępa Kujawska, Kijewo, Klepary,\"}, \"D2S1\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0065-009ad1444e70:d01\", \"start\": 0, \"end\": 323, \"text\": \"nL����14p�\\u0000 , �0 D�Gi �В\\u0014�����Q\\u00107 ��8 -- ���k '' ���k|�t=tH���Ex �w2ޟ�� > -E\\u0017���H\\u0017�B����ą ������X�w�w } � U % V�VU����W % \\u00043C�� ` ��ۉM����\\\\k\\b� �FHn�x�j # �L��9\\u001b [ ��9��-X|�'wm '' ����n߷��\\u0012��\\u0018\\u0010|�3 ( ǚ X� < �\\u0001�\\u0015�Gr �\\u001a�F���\\u001a�ԣUY��� ] ��� ����y��HJH�\\u000f�5�rW� \\u0017a @ V� , Vm�D�\\u000f\\u00062�s ] �䚭\\u00144bvAP�F�C� % � 1\\u0014��0.�9\\u0019L F�H�կ\\u000e�� { H�� !\"}, \"D2S2\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0065-009ad1444e70:d01\", \"start\": 324, \"end\": 574, \"text\": \"��y/��ɜ �C\\u0010�����ַ���T�+������ia ; ��~\\u000e�5 �� # �pg , ���\\u0004C�NHڽ��c�����'�r�yoq� > ��� �C0��0f�e [ ��\\u0005���k endstream endobj 2 0 obj < < /Type /Page /Parent 17 0 R /MediaBox [ 0 0 595.276 841.89 ] /Contents 16 0 R /Resources < < /ProcSet 1 0 R /XObject <\"}}, \"original_cards\": [{\"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0065-009ad1444e70:d00\", \"card_id\": \"ramdocs-0065-009ad1444e70:d00:c0\", \"entity\": \"Gniewkowo\", \"scope\": \"population of the town of Gniewkowo\", \"claim\": \"As of 2006, the population of Gniewkowo amounts to 7,254.\", \"answer\": \"7,254\", \"quote\": \"The gmina covers an area of , and as of 2006 its total population is 14,719 (out of which the population of Gniewkowo amounts to 7,254, and the population of the rural part of the gmina is 7,465).\", \"original_document_number\": 1}], \"current_answers\": [\"7,254\"], \"candidate_answers\": [{\"candidate_id\": \"R0\", \"answer\": \